{#
  templates/env.j2 — docker-compose-app (generic)

  Renders the sibling `.env` for the stack from the flat `dca_env` mapping.
  composition-wiring.md: every config var the entrypoint/config reads is listed
  explicitly here. The CALLER is responsible for having applied `${VAR:-default}`
  empty/default semantics when building `dca_env` (so a var is always present,
  as an empty string at worst, never a KeyError).

  NO secret value is ever written here. Every entry is a non-secret config value
  or a reference-by-name; runtime secrets come from OpenBao via the Agent
  (integration-boundaries §2, PF §11).
#}
# MANAGED BY ANSIBLE (docker-compose-app) — DO NOT EDIT BY HAND.
# Stack: {{ dca_app_name }} — non-secret configuration only.
{% for key, value in dca_env | dictsort %}
{{ key }}={{ value }}
{% endfor %}
